==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*kʷ-}}{{dercat|ru|ine-bsl-pro|inh=1}}
{{inh+|ru|orv|чьто}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*čьto}}, a {{glossary|univerbation}} of {{der|ru|ine-pro|*kʷid}} and {{m|ine-pro|*só|*tód}}.

===Pronunciation===
